Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, curl, python3, coreutils, tar, procps, util-linux
Recommends: faugus-launcher, nftables | iptables, sudo, zenity, libnotify-bin, desktop-file-utils
Description: run the W3Champions launcher inside the Faugus Battle.net prefix
 w3c-linux installs, launches and updates the W3Champions launcher inside the
 Battle.net prefix Faugus Launcher manages, or a prefix set with w3c-linux
 backend set umu.
 .
 faugus-launcher is recommended, not required: the Battle.net prefix and umu-run; without it, w3c-linux backend set umu and a system umu-run.
